Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:13.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:15.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:16.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先别动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:17.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:22.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:25.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先离开一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:45.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有话问你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:13.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不许下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你就跟我一起下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:25.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又是那个贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:48.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:04:59.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:24.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是三郎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:33.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:35.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:42.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:44.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:45.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:46.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放我下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:48.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:51.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:52.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:02.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,弟兄们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:07.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是谁杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:09.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:17.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他没有呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:18.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,和心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:23.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还我兄弟来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要你们死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:29.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎小心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:30.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不用管他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:36.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:37.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是放我下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:38.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你别出手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:58.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你总不能一直抱着我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:06:59.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,未尝不可
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:00.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:03.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:06.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:43.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:45.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下面这些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是你杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:47.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:50.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:52.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次再看到这样的坑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千万别乱往下跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:56.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拦你都拦不住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真不知道该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不再问点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:05.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还想我问什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:07.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,比如
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:08.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是不是人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是不是人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:12.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我觉得没必要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:14.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:15.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:16.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,与人相交
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看的是投缘不投缘 相性如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:21.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又不是看身份
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我若喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你便是乞丐我也喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:26.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我若讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就是皇帝我也讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:31.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再简单不过的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:32.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没必要问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:36.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说得非常有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:38.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:43.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若邪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:50.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们二打一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:53.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一对一你也毫无胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们都是那贱人的走狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不得好死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎 先别杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若想离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:06.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们得从他嘴里问话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:07.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:09.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还是先放我下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:10.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:35.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知道其他人怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:53.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个黑衣女尸会不会把他们也扫下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:57.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:09:58.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,地上很脏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们为那贱人做事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:05.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国千万冤魂不会放过你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.41,0:10:08.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说的那人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:11.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:13.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还能有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:15.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那个妖道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:18.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是效忠于她的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:21.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:25.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永远不会再效忠于她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:27.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我饶不了这个贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:29.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:31.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们杀了我的弟兄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不会回答你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:33.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:34.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,继续打
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:36.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:37.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他没动手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.69,0:10:39.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可以回答他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,然后和我打
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:43.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们都是那贱人的帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:44.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:46.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨将军 你误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:49.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们为铲除半月国师而来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会是她的帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若非听命于她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:55.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们为何杀我弟兄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:58.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你扔我们下来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们总得自保吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:01.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是你们自己非要往下跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:06.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:09.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但现在我们都被困在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:10.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是先休战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:15.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你和那半月国师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到底有什么恩怨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:21.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨将军
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为了你的弟兄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:24.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还是老实回答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:27.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们已经被你灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你休想再以此威胁我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:31.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:32.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可尸体还在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那得看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们半月国人认为
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,尸体是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来世就是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:44.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想要他们来世安康
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:49.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:53.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:59.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别动他们的尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们都曾是英勇的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被困在这坑底多年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:06.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,已是不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:09.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今好不容易解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:13.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,决不能再受侮辱了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们当真是来杀半月的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:21.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:22.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绝无欺瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那半月国师的事迹外人知之甚少
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有您曾与她共事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还请为我们指点一二
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:33.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她恨半月国
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:35.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:37.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可她不是半月国人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:38.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不完全是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:42.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这妖道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是个混血儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她母亲出身半月国
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父亲却是个永安贼人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:55.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那贼人忍不了边境的苦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:57.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最后留下妻儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回了永安
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可怜那半月女子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:09.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟因此心病郁结而死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:12.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,留下了一个六七岁的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:13.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,无人看顾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:16.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这小混血儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:17.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是那妖道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:22.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们半月国人以健壮为美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可她血脉不纯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,生得弱小
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受了点欺负
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:29.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,脾气就变得越来越怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:33.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,后来边境暴乱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:35.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那小混血儿也不知去向
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:41.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她再回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:44.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟有了一身永安的妖邪本领
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:48.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还进了我半月皇宫供职
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:49.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:51.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这法师是个妖道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,万万不可啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,妖道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:56.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何出此言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她操控的蝎尾蛇太过邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若哪天她动了歪念
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们连解药都来不及用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:05.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说的是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她就是个妖道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:07.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:11.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何况她身上还流着永安贼人的血
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是个杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她就是恶毒的蝎尾蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:17.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,派来祸害半月国的妖魔呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:19.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你有什么话要说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:24.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,陛下 她默认了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:25.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绞死她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是的 绞死她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绞死她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:28.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都安静\N绞死她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都安静
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:30.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:32.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那时 我看她可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:38.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便对国主求情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:41.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你跟着我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:00.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,弟兄们 干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:03.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这帮沙漠强盗终于被我们剿灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:04.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回去复命后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:06.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好处少不了大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.25,0:15:07.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:10.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:11.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:13.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,干什么慌慌张张的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:17.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风暴来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这沙下巢穴没有栋梁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.47,0:15:21.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很快就要塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:23.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:23.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:24.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:29.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,撤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:30.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:31.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:31.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走\N快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:31.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:31.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快\N快走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:31.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:32.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:33.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:35.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在那种情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:53.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被掩埋的弟兄们根本不可能生还
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只能先带活着的人走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:04.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:07.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把死去的弟兄们带回家去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:08.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一个都别落下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:09.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:11.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:12.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:37.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:38.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是将军来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:39.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:40.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:42.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军来救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:43.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 她竟挖了个地洞\N- 将军来救我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:44.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她竟挖了个地洞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:46.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让受伤的士兵避难
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后又挖出了死者的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:55.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一切都是她独自一人徒手所为
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:56.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,至此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:16:59.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我觉得她不会祸害半月国
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:00.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便一力担保
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把所有反对的声音都驳了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:05.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她做事很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而且本事很大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:08.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,深藏不露
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:11.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我便一路举荐她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:15.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将她送上了国师之位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:30.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师 国师人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回禀将军
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,国师从开战就不见了人影了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:36.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:39.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,报
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军 国师把城门打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:43.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:16.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么我如此信任她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,她还要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:20.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这妖道是个叛贼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:23.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,活该被吊死在这罪人坑上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:26.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨将军
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您先冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:28.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘘
